  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 144 ÷ 12 + 12 −12 × 12 = 1\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) = and ×\n\n144 ÷ 12 + 12 −12 × 12 = 1 ⇒ 144 ÷ 12 + 12 −12 = 12 × 1\n\n⇒ __**144 ÷ 12**__ + 12 −12 = __**12 **____**× 1**__\n\n⇒ __**12 + 12**__ −12 = 12\n\n⇒ __**24 −12**__ = 12\n\n**⇒ 12 = 12 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) + and −\n\n144 ÷ 12 + 12 −12 × 12 = 1 ⇒ 144 ÷ 12 - 12 + 12 × 12 = 1\n\n⇒ __**144 ÷ 12**__ - 12 + 12 × 12 = 1\n\n⇒ 12 - 12 + __**12 × 12**__ = 1\n\n⇒ __**12 + 144**__ - 12 = 1\n\n⇒ __156____** - 12**__ = 1\n\n⇒ 144 ≠ 1 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) ÷ and −\n\n144 ÷ 12 + 12 −12 × 12 = 1 ⇒ 144 - 12 + 12 ÷ 12 × 12 = 1\n\n⇒ 144 - 12 + __**12 **____**÷ **____**12**__ × 12 = 1\n\n⇒ 144 - 12 + __**1**____** × 12**__ = 1\n\n⇒ __**144 + 12**__ - 12 = 1\n\n⇒ __156** - 12**__ = 1\n\n⇒ 144 ≠ 1 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) × and −\n\n144 ÷ 12 + 12 −12 × 12 = 1 ⇒ 144 ÷ 12 + 12 × 12 - 12 = 1\n\n⇒ __**144 ÷ 12**__ + 12 × 12 - 12 = 1\n\n⇒ 12 + __**12 **____**× **____**12**__ - 12 = 1\n\n⇒ __**12 + **144__ - 12 = 1\n\n⇒ __**156**____** - 12**__ = 1\n\n⇒ 144 ≠ 1 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
